Audio playout: duplicate and late frames are dropped, not a restart (his patch 9); the relay link's test.
From whatsapp-light's patched meowcaller (github.com/vbbot/whatsapp-light, by Vasu Bhatia, its
meowcaller/ at commit d185e2c; notes in its meowcaller/PATCHES-wa-poc.md), against upstream meowcaller
c48c3e2. Used with the author's agreement, given to the HyperBerry user on 2026-11-07; the licence
is to follow in his repository. Applied in order by scripts/hypermeow-work.sh.

